<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 418-1 AT LUNCH VS INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 418-1 AT LUNCH VS INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, replying to India's first innings score of 537-8 declared, were 418 for one at lunch on the fourth day of the first test match at Colombo on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 1st innings 537-8 declared; Sri Lanka 418-1 (S.Jayasuriya not out 230, R.Mahanama not out 150)</p>
